    "Content": "Grace means treating defeated enemies with dignity. Allowing healing and foregiveness. The show actually demonstrates this pretty well in the breezies episode, where Fluttershy tries to be nice to the bees before using The Stare and when she is nice to the dragon in Dragonshy. Being graceful means acknowledging an enemy but giving a path to reconciliation."
