  {
    "Content": "Tribalism refers to selective empathy - I must harm others to improve my clan. It\u0027s an us vs. them mentality (very prevelant in the real world today). I am kind to US, which requires me to be cruel to THEM. It drives wedge issues that split commoners (\u0022My race is better than yours\u0022)"
