    "Content": "Tribalism leads to \u0022dehumanization\u0022 of the enemy (\u0022They are not creatures. They are animals.\u0022). Grace means treating your enemies as proper creatures. This fits Fluttershy really well thematically, since she actually treats all animals as proper creatures. (This is why Fluttershy has the best arc and characterization in the show!)"
