    "Content": "Grace is \u0022The Energy of Being\u0022 as the second half of Ambition \u0022The Will of Doing\u0022. Grace means the ability to exist in the moment, to accept oneself and others, to find peace and connection. Ambition is the…

…the GR and needs Equestria to join the alliance, and why it\u0027s good that the GR turns the sword towards Chrysalis instead of Aquileia."
