    "Content": "Change the game so that cooperation is the best option\r\nThe elements of liberty are what you get when you are strong but still choose to be cooperative instead of conquer. The theme is \u0022you have to…

…abuse. Make the cost of conquering too high, and a rational player will have to trade. This will make every creature high asset specificity, high agency, high safety\r\nIn the bedroom, if the griffoness abused Coltbert, she wouldn\u0027t get another chance at an affair and be blacklisted, so she is forced to woo.\r\nIn the economy, if someone with special knowledge is taken away, their crop is gone from the market. Forced to trade"
